  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-black text-white\"><section class=\"relative pt-24 pb-8 md:pt-32 md:pb-16 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img src=\"/assets/hero-c0817d4e.webp\" alt=\"Collection of classic cars\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/70 via-black/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-900 via-neutral-900/20 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl tracking-tight mb-6\">Sell your collection at auction. We take care of everything.</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-8\">On-site valuation, package photography, and wide exposure. One contact, one agreement, multiple sales. Whether it's an estate, bankruptcy, dealer, or private - We help you.</p><div class=\"text-center md:text-left md:flex justify-between gap-4 items-center\"><a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"inline-block rounded-full border-2 border-white px-8 py-4 hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors font-medium text-lg cursor-pointer\">Get Contacted</a><p class=\"block text-neutral-400 text-sm mt-4 md:mt-0\">We typically respond within 1 business day.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-neutral-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-16\">How We Help You</h2><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12\"><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img src=\"/assets/europeiskt-natverk-29c8f7b8.webp\" alt=\"Reach Across Europe\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">Reach Across Europe</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">We have over 30,000 serious and dedicated bidders in both Sweden and Europe actively looking for enthusiast cars. More qualified bidders means better exposure – especially when multiple cars are auctioned simultaneously.</p></div><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img src=\"/assets/vi-gor-jobbet-at-dig-ca9116ed.webp\" alt=\"We Handle Everything – At Your Location\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">We Handle Everything – At Your Location</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">One contact person to help you. We come to you, photograph, document, and write compelling descriptions. The more cars, the better package price on photography and administration.</p></div><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img src=\"/assets/experter-1bff6046.webp\" alt=\"Right Reserve Price, Secure Transaction\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">Right Reserve Price, Secure Transaction</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">After handling thousands of enthusiast cars, we know when and how your collection should be sold we have all available statistics to help you. You get advice on reserve price and timeline to maximize interest.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-12\">Professional Photos That Sell Your Collection</h2><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed text-center mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">We highlight paint, interior, and details – and show the complete picture. We work with professional photographers nationwide. Consistent photo style across all cars builds trust and drives bidding.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img src=\"/assets/collection-leads-4-988657b9.webp\" alt=\"Full shot – Mustang in setting (consistent style)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img src=\"/assets/collection-leads-8-82d97edd.webp\" alt=\"Group shot – multiple cars in the same setting (consistent style)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img src=\"/assets/collection-leads-9-4c7c40c2.webp\" alt=\"Interior – steering wheel, instruments, seats (show condition)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-racing-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"bg-racing-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-4 lg:py-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">200 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Visitors/month</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">30 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Registered users</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">150+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Images per auction</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">250 MSEK+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Bid volume/month</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-off-white text-black\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-4\">Latest collections</h2><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-8 items-stretch\"><li><a href=\"/en/themes/stars-of-stuttgart\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/1cece29f9b33e4f4efad95d0f33dda8f\" alt=\"Stars of Stuttgart\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1\">Stars of Stuttgart</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">Starting off the new year with 9 lovely Mercedes-Benz models!</p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/themes/the-911-rally-collection\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/46ffa7963ee5c50d945237dee1b53efb\" alt=\"The 911 Rally Collection\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1\">The 911 Rally Collection</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">Do you dream of a true rally icon? Now you have the chance to acquire legendary Porsche 911 rally cars with a proven racing history and exceptional performance. Seize the opportunity to bid on a piece of motorsport history through Bidders Highway!</p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/themes/the-m-collection\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/911feb27f434e31d708f0ff6aa14b430\" alt=\"The M Collection\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1\">The M Collection</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">Welcome to The M Collection, an exclusive auction offering some of the most sought-after and legendary BMW models from the 1990s and early 2000s. Here, you have the opportunity to acquire some of BMW's most iconic sports cars – each with its own unique history and design.</p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/themes/ett-sista-race\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/57676fdf58e92afcf5ffbfb5242fe24b\" alt=\"Ett Sista Race-samlingen\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1\">Ett Sista Race-samlingen</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">Since its invention, the automobile has starred in many films around the world. If you are interested in cars, film, and culture, you now have a unique chance to bid on a collection of movie cars. Bidders Highway is honoured to present the first set of cars from the movie The Last Race. The collection consists of something for everyone. American, German, Japanese and of course Swedish!</p></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-off-white text-black\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">What our customers say</h2></div></section><section id=\"contact-form\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-neutral-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6\">Ready to Sell Your Collection?</h2><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">Leave your details and we'll call for three quick questions number of cars, condition, and location. We typically respond within 1 business day.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-8\" id=\"new_lead\" action=\"/en/collection_leads\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_owner\">Name</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"Your name\" type=\"text\" name=\"lead[owner]\" id=\"lead_owner\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_email\">E-mail</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" name=\"lead[email]\" id=\"lead_email\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_phone\">Phone number</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"+46 70 123 45 67\" required=\"required\" type=\"tel\" name=\"lead[phone]\" id=\"lead_phone\"></div><input name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\"><input class=\"absolute -z-10\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\" name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" id=\"lead_accept_terms\"><div class=\"pt-6 text-center\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Get Contacted\" class=\"inline-block rounded-full border-2 border-white px-8 py-4 hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors font-medium text-lg text-white cursor-pointer w-full md:w-auto\" data-disable-with=\"Create Inquiry\"></div></form></div></section></div></main>",
